sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TV as Unbound TV
  participant Coach as Coach Web
  participant API as Server API
  participant Store as Store
  participant MQTT as MQTT Gateway
  participant EMQX as EMQX Broker

  TV->>TV: 生成 deviceId + pairToken
  TV-->>Coach: 展示二维码
  TV->>API: POST heartbeat / pairing presence
  Coach->>API: 扫码提交 deviceId + screenNumber
  API->>API: 校验 Coach 场馆权限
  API->>Store: bind deviceId -> venue namespace + screenNumber
  Store-->>API: bound tvScreen
  API->>MQTT: publish assign_screen to __unbound__
  MQTT->>EMQX: infini/tv/control/__unbound__
  EMQX-->>TV: assign_screen
  TV->>TV: 保存 accountNamespace + screenNumber
  TV->>EMQX: 订阅 infini/tv/control/{namespace}
  TV->>API: GET daily-checksum
  API-->>TV: checksum + schedules summary
  TV->>API: GET daily-bundle if changed
  API-->>TV: schedules + resources
  TV->>TV: 下载/校验媒体缓存
  TV-->>TV: 进入今日课表

